@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Frontend - Gestion de estado y flujo de datos cliente

component "AuthProvider\nReact Context" as AuthProvider EZ_FRONTEND
database "localStorage\n token, user" as LocalStorage EZ_DB
component "fetchWithAuth\nlib/api-client.ts" as FetchClient
component "SWR cache\nportfolio, wallet, orders,\ntransactions, offers" as SwrCache EZ_FRONTEND
component "Estado local de formularios\nuseState en paginas/formularios" as LocalState EZ_FRONTEND
component "Paginas Next\nHome, Dashboard, Trading,\nWallet, Market" as Pages EZ_FRONTEND
component "NotificationsWebSocket\ncliente STOMP" as WsClient EZ_FRONTEND
component "Estado en memoria de toasts\ncomponents/ui/toaster.tsx" as ToastState EZ_FRONTEND
component "API REST backend" as RestApi EZ_BACKEND
component "Backend STOMP /ws" as StompApi EZ_BACKEND

AuthProvider --> LocalStorage : restore, persist,\nclear token/user
AuthProvider --> FetchClient : authApi.getUser\nwith token
Pages --> AuthProvider : useAuth()
Pages --> SwrCache : useSWR reads\nmutate refresh
Pages --> LocalState : dialogs, forms,\nfilters, loading flags
SwrCache --> FetchClient : feature API fetchers
FetchClient --> RestApi : JSON + Authorization header
FetchClient --> LocalStorage : remove auth on 401\nand dispatch auth:unauthorized
WsClient --> AuthProvider : token
WsClient --> StompApi : connectHeaders Authorization
StompApi --> WsClient : notification payloads
WsClient --> ToastState : toast({ title, body, variant })

note right of SwrCache
Evidencia: useSWR in dashboard/page.tsx,
trading/page.tsx y wallet/page.tsx.
end note

note bottom
No se ha encontrado una libreria global de estado como Redux o Zustand.
El estado se reparte entre React Context, localStorage, SWR y useState local de componente.
end note

@enduml
